{"id": "45978", "title": "我的绝色道侣们", "author": "仿宋", "category": "武侠修真", "count": 142, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/45/45978.htm", "intro": "一入欲海难回头，乘风破浪阴阳舟，他日渡得轮回岸，拈花微笑千情留。古董店伙计楚小天穿越时空，阴差阳错加入了双修门，并拥有了一个貌美如花的女师父。正在窃喜之时，却发现自己只不过是人家采阳补阴的炉鼎。真正的双修门传承己涅灭于岁月，如今的双修门只是走上邪路的偏宗。在骷髅山后，双修门末代传人临终收徒。秉师遗志，楚小天纵尽天才，力揽百美，降合欢宗、绝情谷、玉女门，终将双修门一朝大统。                  [更多简介]", "base": "files/article/html/45/45978", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1 幻世风月", "file": "6217631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2 浪荡子弟", "file": "6217632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3 错抱佳人", "file": "6217633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4、合欢门徒", "file": "6217634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5、半夜勾魂", "file": "6217635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6 非礼勿听", "file": "6217636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7、除草力士", "file": "6217637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8 合情散", "file": "6217638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9 师姐不要", "file": "6217639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10 第一次啊", "file": "6217640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11 阳鱼吸功", "file": "6217641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12 走火入魔", "file": "6217642.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13 风波再起", "file": "6217643.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１４ 赔礼道歉", "file": "6217644.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15 卖身三年", "file": "6217645.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16 柔情似水", "file": "6217646.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17 合欢临劫", "file": "6217647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１８ 暧昧留言", "file": "6217648.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19 古洞美人", "file": "6217649.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20 师门遗宝", "file": "6217650.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21 楚家大少", "file": "6217651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22 花见花开", "file": "6217652.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23 梅州风云", "file": "6217653.html", "available": false}, {"titl